    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/personal-coach-lite/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Personal Coach Lite Theme is a sleek, responsive, and user-friendly solution tailored for personal trainers, fitness coaches, wellness mentors, and health consultants seeking to establish a robust digital presence. This theme is perfect for promoting personalized fitness plans, weight loss programs, post-injury rehabilitation, high-intensity interval training (HIIT), and nutrition-focused coaching. It serves as a powerful platform for offering one-on-one sessions, virtual classes, and customized workout routines, all while featuring a modern and appealing design. With dedicated sections for client success stories, testimonials, certifications, coaching packages, and transformation galleries, the theme helps build trust and credibility. Its fully responsive layout ensures smooth performance across all devices, making it easy for clients to explore services, book sessions, or access fitness guidance on the go. Additional features include meal plan integration, progress tracking tools, and email newsletter sign-ups to boost client engagement. Optimized for SEO and fast loading speeds, with flexible customization options for layouts, colors, and fonts, the Personal Coach Lite Theme provides a comprehensive, professional solution for coaches and mentors eager to enhance their brand and expand their online fitness business."
    },
